<title>USA: CENTRAL U.S. CARLOT PORK AT 1115 CDT - USDA.</title>
<headline>CENTRAL U.S. CARLOT PORK AT 1115 CDT - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fresh loins untested; Butts steady to firm; sknd. hams generally steady; sdls.  bellies steady to 2.00 lower; lean trimmings 3.00 lower.</p>
<p>Trading moderate, with light demand and moderate offerings for processing items, while retail cuts experienced moderate demand and  offerings.</p>
